desc=Legend authoritative game server: HTTP MVC admin with GM pages (players / online / announcements / realms) plus a LAN TCP game gateway. Every game number (levels, jobs, drops, forge, shop, rebirth, encounters) is read from the rule tables under data/rules at startup -- no gameplay constant lives in code.
desc.zh=传奇权威服务端模板：HTTP MVC 管理后台（玩家/在线/公告/区服 GM 页）+ 局域网 TCP 游戏网关。全部玩法数值（等级曲线、职业成长、掉落权重、锻造、商店、转生、挑战曲线）启动时读 data/rules 规则表，代码里不留玩法常量。
